Mattermost Viewport Read Receipts

This is an independent plugin. It is not an official Mattermost product.

The server uses the Mattermost public Go plugin SDK:
  github.com/mattermost/mattermost/server/public v0.1.21
  https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost/tree/server/public/v0.1.21/server/public
  Copyright Mattermost, Inc.
  The SDK's license text is in its LICENSE.txt file.

Runtime JavaScript uses React and ReactDOM provided by the host Mattermost
web application; it does not bundle separate copies of those libraries.

Go dependencies and exact versions are listed in go.mod and go.sum.
Web build and test dependencies are listed in webapp/package.json and
webapp/package-lock.json. Third-party components remain under their own
licenses; selecting a license for this plugin does not relicense them.
